                                                          "Kontrakt"@da ,
                                                          "Vertrag"@de ;
          <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#applicableContentCategories> :ContractualDocument ;
          <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#extractionPrompt> "The contract, identified by any means (id, name, title etc). If not explicitly mentioned, a descriptive term/title *must* be used instead."@en .


###  https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ContractCondition
:ContractCondition rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ,
                            <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#EntityCategory> ;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A condition that must be met as part of a contractual obligation."@en ,
                                                                    "Eine Bedingung, die im Rahmen einer vertraglichen Verpflichtung erfüllt werden muss."@de ,
                                                                    "En betingelse, der skal opfyldes som led i en kontraktlig forpligtelse."@da ,
                                                                    "Una condizione che deve essere soddisfatta nell'ambito di un obbligo contrattuale."@it ,
                                                                    "Une condition qui doit être satisfaite dans le cadre d'une obligation contractuelle."@fr ;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contract Condition"@en ,
                                                                   "Contrat Condition"@fr ,
                                                                   "Contratto Condizione"@it ,
                                                                   "Kontrakt Betingelse"@da ,
                                                                   "Vertrag Bedingung"@de ;
                   <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#applicableContentCategories> :ContractualDocument ;
                   <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#extractionPrompt> "A certain condition that must be met, as part of a 'ContractObligation'."@en .


###  https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ContractObligation
:ContractObligation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ,
                             <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#EntityCategory> ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An obligation that a party must fulfil under a contract."@en ,
                                                                     "Eine Verpflichtung, die eine Partei im Rahmen eines Vertrags erfüllen muss."@de ,
                                                                     "En forpligtelse, som en part skal opfylde i henhold til en kontrakt."@da ,
                                                                     "Un obbligo che una parte deve adempiere ai sensi di un contratto."@it ,
                                                                     "Une obligation qu'une partie doit remplir au titre d'un contrat."@fr ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contract Obligation"@en ,
                                                                    "Contrat Obligation"@fr ,
                                                                    "Contratto Obligation"@it ,
                                                                    "Kontrakt Obligation"@da ,
                                                                    "Vertrag Obligation"@de ;
                    <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#applicableContentCategories> :ContractualDocument ;
                    <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#extractionPrompt> "A certain obligation that must be undertaken in the context of the 'Contract'."@en .


