                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ,
                       <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#EntityCategory> ;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role undertaken by a party (organization or person) within a specific contract."@en ,
