                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dessins, spécifications et modèles qui définissent la géométrie, les matériaux et l'intention de conception."@fr ,
                                                                 "Disegni, specifiche e modelli che definiscono geometria, materiali e intento progettuale."@it ,
                                                                 "Drawings, specifications, and models that define geometry, materials, and design intent."@en ,
                                                                 "Tegninger, specifikationer og modeller, der definerer geometri, materialer og designhensigt."@da ,
                                                                 "Zeichnungen, Spezifikationen und Modelle, die Geometrie, Materialien und Entwurfsabsicht definieren."@de ;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Design Document"@da ,
                                                                "Design Document"@de ,
                                                                "Design Document"@en ,
                                                                "Design Document"@fr ,
                                                                "Design Document"@it ;
                <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#classificationPrompt> "Documents that define geometry, materials, and design intent, such as architectural drawings, engineering designs, landscape or interior plans, BIM models, and renderings."@en .


