                                                                    "Drawing Orientation"@en ,
                                                                    "Drawing Orientation"@fr ,
                                                                    "Drawing Orientation"@it ;
                    <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#applicableContentCategories> :DesignDocument ;
                    <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#extractionPrompt> "The orientation of a 'DrawingEntity'."@en .


###  https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#DrawingScale
