                                                              "Drawing Scale"@it ;
              <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#applicableContentCategories> :DesignDocument ;
              <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#extractionPrompt> "The scale of a 'DrawingEntity' or of a 'DrawingSheet'."@en .


###  https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#DrawingSheet
:DrawingSheet rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ,
                       <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#EntityCategory> ;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sheet of a technical drawing set that contains one or more drawings, usually with a title block holding design metadata."@en ,
                                                               "Ein Blatt eines technischen Zeichnungssatzes, das eine oder mehrere Zeichnungen enthält, meist mit einem Schriftfeld mit Entwurfsmetadaten."@de ,
                                                               "Et ark i et teknisk tegningssæt, der indeholder en eller flere tegninger, normalt med et titelfelt med designmetadata."@da ,
                                                               "Un foglio di una serie di disegni tecnici che contiene uno o più disegni, di solito con un cartiglio contenente i metadati di progetto."@it ,
                                                               "Une planche d'un jeu de plans techniques contenant un ou plusieurs dessins, généralement avec un cartouche regroupant les métadonnées de conception."@fr ;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Drawing Sheet"@da ,
                                                              "Drawing Sheet"@de ,
                                                              "Drawing Sheet"@en ,
                                                              "Drawing Sheet"@fr ,
                                                              "Drawing Sheet"@it ;
              <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#applicableContentCategories> :ConstructionProcessDocument ,
                                                                      :DesignDocument ;
              <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#extractionPrompt> "A sheet of a technical drawing, that contains one or more 'DrawingEntity'. Most often contains a title block with 'DesignMetadata'. It is identified by name, title or id."@en .


